SUMMARY:Funny & Pink: Comedy Show & Breast Cancer Awareness Award Ceremony
LOCATION:The Stand Up Comedy Club
DESCRIPTION:A Whole Lot of Funny Ent. presents the Funny & Pink Comedy Show
 
 & Breast Cancer Awareness Award Ceremony---an evening celebrating strength
 
\, survivors\, community\, and some seriously funny people. Brandon Wiley h
 
osts the festivities before Oakland powerhouse Mario Hodge takes over. Hodg
 
e's wildly animated comedy has landed him alongside Kevin Hart\, Charlie Mu
 
rphy and Mo'Nique---and in 2026\, he was crowned winner of the Bay Area Bla
 
ck Comedy Competition. Carly Carr\, a former America's Funniest Moms finali
 
st\, brings the laughs\, while The Legendary DJ Count keeps the soundtrack 
 
moving. Wear some pink\, bring your people\, and grab those tickets before 
 
this celebration packs the house! *****************************************
 
